      "repository": "sepahead/haldir",
      "run_id": 30477542511,
      "summary": "The signed FR-0012 repair commit's main CI run 30477542511 exposed both defects without falsification. Attempt 1 encountered a Linux procfs TOCTOU assertion race where stat read raised ProcessLookupError [Errno 3] after the presence probe; attempt 2 was a selective failed-job rerun with carried successful jobs and attempt createdAt 17:57:10Z after startedAt 17:57:08Z; attempt 3 was a successful full rerun with createdAt 18:03:52Z after startedAt 18:03:46Z. The epoch-13 verifier honestly rejected these observations. Hosted artifacts and OIDC attestations existed, but no canonical FR-0012 qualification evidence was captured or committed and no release authority was produced.",
